# One line ending for the whole repo: LF in the repository and in the working tree.
# SKDJ's decision, 2026-11-16: settled by Git rather than by discipline, so no prompt has to ask.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Delivered bytes, never text. The extension ships as built JavaScript, and Node and VS Code read
# LF on every platform, so neither the Windows build nor the packaged VSIX is affected.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.vsix binary

# Third-party minified code (marked, DOMPurify, highlight.js): leave its bytes as delivered.
media/vendor/** -text
